From 80991786084bd2f32aabe2781c60ea09aed2db91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:53:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Elevator 0.1.1: see jumps from the player's movement too, and
 /elevator debug

The jump count alone did not move for the owner of a world on the integrated server. A jump is
now also read from the ground flag leaving with a rise, or from a rise off an elevator. The wait
after a ride applies only to those, so a sneak right after riding still works.
---
